# Accepted risks for the CI image scan (trivy image --severity HIGH,CRITICAL --ignore-unfixed).
# One CVE id per line, each with a comment giving the reason and a review date, e.g.
#   # Reason: only reachable through X, which the portal never uses. Review by 2027-01-31.
#   CVE-2026-00000
# Keep this list short: fix by updating the base image or the dependency whenever possible.

# krb5-libs 1.21.1-10.el9_8.1 in the API's runtime base image (ubi9/openjdk-21-runtime); fixed in
# 1.21.1-10.el9_9.2, which is not in the public UBI 9 BaseOS repository yet, so a rebuild cannot take
# it. Reason: every one is in the KDC (krb5kdc) or the admin server (kadmind); neither image has
# krb5-server or any Kerberos daemon, only the client library the operating system's tools link, and
# the JVM does its own Kerberos. Remove these once UBI publishes el9_9.2. Review by 2026-12-15.
